            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "xLBby",
              "name": "docNote",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Mc621",
                  "name": "docNoteTitle",
                  "fill": "#222222",
                  "content": "关键需求标注",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "xW9hg",
                  "name": "docNoteWrap",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#F7F7F7",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": 16,
                  "gap": 10,
                  "cornerRadius": 6,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Rrix6",
                      "name": "docNote0",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "1. 台账字段严格按 PRD 2.9.3：编号 / 标题 / 格式 / 所属分类 / 权限标签 / 更新时间 / 启用状态。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "kdRPh",
                      "name": "docNote1",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "2. 「权限标签」读的是 kb_documents.permission_summary（列表展示用的摘要），**它不是鉴权依据**——鉴权以 kb_permissions 为准。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "b8YVl",
                      "name": "docNote2",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "3. 未配置权限的文档显示「未配置(默认不可读)」并标橙：PRD 规定「默认状态下知识单元无任何公开访问权限」。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "DqB5d",
                      "name": "docNote3",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "4. 导入按 file_hash（SHA256）去重：同内容重复上传直接复用已有知识单元，不重复解析与向量化。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "wmHwd",
                      "name": "docNote4",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "5. 导入是重任务，走受限并发执行器（同时最多 2 个），不能阻塞在线问答。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "CxuzJ",
                      "name": "docNote5",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "6. 任务进度读 kb_import_tasks（已持久化），刷新页面或重启服务都不丢进度。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
